  &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400 !important; font-size: 1.3em !important; color: #000;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/181886/rss" title="developer.chrome.com" style=" color: #D94306;"&gt;Request for Developer Feedback: &lt;code&gt;focusgroup&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; — This proposed HTML attribute aims to provide a declarative way to add keyboard arrow-key navigation to composite widgets (such as toolbars, tablists, menus, etc) replacing “&lt;em&gt;hundreds of lines of boilerplate&lt;/em&gt;”.&lt;/p&gt;
